Implemented the boolean transform and future-version cache handling. Fixed incomplete-transform publication, registry-version reuse, cached metadata consistency, and HTML escaping; added regression coverage.

**Trade-off:** Failed runs now remove previous reports and cache state before processing. This guarantees no artifacts remain after a transform failure, at the cost of losing the last successful artifacts and cache on failure.

**Verification after changes:** `python3 -m unittest` passed all 22 tests. `python3 reportgen.py --rules rules.example.toml` completed successfully.

